define(['jquery','mage/translate'],function($,$t){$.widget('ambase.messageToggler',{options:{additionalText:'',togglerBtn:{showText:$t('View More'),hideText:$t('Hide')}},textContainerSelector:'[data-ambase-message-additional]',toggleBtnSelector:'[data-ambase-message-toggle-btn]',isOpen:false,_create:function(){if(!this.options.additionalText.length){return;}
this._bind();},_bind:function(){this._on({[`click ${this.toggleBtnSelector}`]:this.toggle});},toggle:function(event){event.preventDefault();this.isOpen?this.hide():this.show();},show:function(){this.getTextContainer().append(this.options.additionalText);this.getTogglerBtn().text(this.options.togglerBtn.hideText);this.isOpen=true;},hide:function(){this.getTextContainer().empty();this.getTogglerBtn().text(this.options.togglerBtn.showText);this.isOpen=false;},getTextContainer:function(){return $(this.element).find(this.textContainerSelector);},getTogglerBtn:function(){return $(this.element).find(this.toggleBtnSelector);}});return $.ambase.messageToggler;});